'' RUN: 'g( p ) = v' over a byref g is 'g( p = v )' (TKO0931), and the comparison converts to
'' the POINTER parameter -- null for false, -1 for true. clang refused 'zext i1 to ptr'.
'' Expected output is fbc-modern 1.20's, byte for byte.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/byref-eq-ptr.tiko -o tests/codegen/byrefeqptr.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/byrefeqptr.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/byrefeqptr.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
